{"4092180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cooking Cave", "steam_appid": 4092180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR KITCHEN CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/9e48ab5a4edd4eaef633f6f9e436c6e7.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/9e48ab5a4edd4eaef633f6f9e436c6e7.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/9e48ab5a4edd4eaef633f6f9e436c6e7.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and lead a culinary disaster deep beneath the surface. If the monster stays hungry, someone is bound to become the next course.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNT FOR INGREDIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/d1889bb7303deda8631bd92ebc228d4f.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/d1889bb7303deda8631bd92ebc228d4f.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/d1889bb7303deda8631bd92ebc228d4f.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a dark dungeon filled with deadly traps and hostile creatures. Sneak past danger or fight your way through to collect rare ingredients. Enemies are unpredictable—stay alert!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEED THE BEAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/ff6e7cad46719f2a4f36476f2fb16576.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/ff6e7cad46719f2a4f36476f2fb16576.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/ff6e7cad46719f2a4f36476f2fb16576.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your ingredients back to the kitchen and cook the perfect meal. Load it into the catapult and launch it straight into the monster's jaws. Get the recipe right and it'll be satisfied. Get it wrong... run before you become dinner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY RUN IS A NEW RECIPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/0b7ad88833bab53948a4530f0ccdcd2b.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/0b7ad88833bab53948a4530f0ccdcd2b.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/0b7ad88833bab53948a4530f0ccdcd2b.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster's cravings change every time. Play it safe with common ingredients or risk everything for rare ones hidden deep in its lair. The bigger your team, the more ingredients you can carry—and cook together!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR KITCHEN CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/9e48ab5a4edd4eaef633f6f9e436c6e7.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/9e48ab5a4edd4eaef633f6f9e436c6e7.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/9e48ab5a4edd4eaef633f6f9e436c6e7.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends and lead a culinary disaster deep beneath the surface. If the monster stays hungry, someone is bound to become the next course.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUNT FOR INGREDIENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/d1889bb7303deda8631bd92ebc228d4f.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/d1889bb7303deda8631bd92ebc228d4f.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/d1889bb7303deda8631bd92ebc228d4f.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a dark dungeon filled with deadly traps and hostile creatures. Sneak past danger or fight your way through to collect rare ingredients. Enemies are unpredictable—stay alert!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEED THE BEAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/ff6e7cad46719f2a4f36476f2fb16576.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/ff6e7cad46719f2a4f36476f2fb16576.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/ff6e7cad46719f2a4f36476f2fb16576.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your ingredients back to the kitchen and cook the perfect meal. Load it into the catapult and launch it straight into the monster's jaws. Get the recipe right and it'll be satisfied. Get it wrong... run before you become dinner.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERY RUN IS A NEW RECIPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/0b7ad88833bab53948a4530f0ccdcd2b.poster.avif?t=1785503439\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/0b7ad88833bab53948a4530f0ccdcd2b.webm?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4092180/extras/0b7ad88833bab53948a4530f0ccdcd2b.mp4?t=1785503439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster's cravings change every time. Play it safe with common ingredients or risk everything for rare ones hidden deep in its lair. The bigger your team, the more ingredients you can carry—and cook together!</p>", "short_description": "A co-op survival horror for up to 4 players. Descend into the dungeon, gather ingredients while avoiding traps and monsters, then cook a meal for a starving beast. Learn its tastes, choose the right ingredients, and don't become dinner yourself! More hands m